{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And I appeared.</b> Rashi explained: He spoke with him judgment. And also in every place it seems to me it is a matter of rebuke, for it is not written ויאמר but rather וידבר, and: ״אב לכלם דבר האיש אדוני הארץ אתנו קשות״." "<b>And He said to him: I am YHWH.</b> What is ״אני ה׳״? That is to say: even though I said to you, ״See, I have made you Elohim to Pharaoh״ — you are not Elohim except to Pharaoh, but I am YHWH also to you."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:02:47.231364426Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}